  <Docs>
    <summary>
            A structured items view that supports item selection.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
      <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.SelectableItemsView" /> extends <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.StructuredItemsView" /> to add selection capabilities.
            Use <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.SelectableItemsView.SelectionMode" /> to control whether single or multiple items can be selected.
            The <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.SelectableItemsView.SelectedItem" /> and <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.SelectableItemsView.SelectedItems" /> properties track the current selection,
            and the <see cref="E:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.SelectableItemsView.SelectionChanged" /> event notifies when selection changes.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
